  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responding to Urgent Needs of Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs) in Yemen with Shelter and Cash Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with the overall allocation strategy to improve living conditions and local integration for internally displaced persons (IDPs) in Yemen who do not wish to relocate, IOM is providing transitional shelter, shelter rehabilitation support, and multipurpose cash assistance (MPCA) under this intervention.</narrative>
  </description>
